    <description>When a Part Code Request is created (not a sandbox replica), creates one Pending Approval per active PKR Approver Definition. Definitions with a username are assigned to the matching active user and notified; definitions without a username (Product Manager) are created unassigned for the request creator or a System Administrator to assign.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>NotificationBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Request &quot; &amp; {!$Record.Name} &amp; &quot; (&quot; &amp; {!$Record.Title__c} &amp; &quot;) needs your approval for &quot; &amp; {!Loop_Notify.Sector__c} &amp; &quot;. Open the request and set your Approval to Approved or Rejected.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>PKR Create Approvals {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>PKR Create Approvals</label>
    <loops>
